5 tw:line-clamp-2 tw:w-full tw:text-xs tw:font-normal tw:leading-[1.45] tw:text-ink/58">Connect your favorite AI client to DSers and move from product discovery to listings, store operations, orders, fulfillment, and delivery tracking — all in one conversation.</span></a><a class="tw:flex tw:px-3 tw:!text-ink tw:transition-colors tw:hover:bg-ink/[0.035] tw:focus-visible:outline-none tw:focus-visible:ring-2 tw:focus-visible:ring-ink tw:flex-col tw:items-start tw:justify-center tw:py-2.5" href="https://www.dsers.dev/"><span class="tw:flex tw:items-center tw:gap-2 tw:text-base tw:font-semibold">Open API</span><span class="tw:mt-1.5 tw:line-clamp-2 tw:w-full tw:text-xs tw:font-normal tw:leading-[1.45] tw:text-ink/58">Through DSers Open API, you can join the millions of merchants who operate their business on DSers and create your own application to showcase to even more merchants.</span></a></div><div class="tw:flex tw:flex-col tw:px-8 tw:py-6"><div class="tw:overflow-hidden tw:rounded-2xl tw:bg-surface"><div class="tw:relative tw:overflow-hidden tw:aspect-[16/5.5]"><img alt="Illustration of AI assistants connected to DSers MCP tools" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="tw:object-cover tw:transition-[opacity,transform] tw:duration-300 tw:ease-[cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1)]" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 34vw, 100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fmcp-server%2Fmcp-hero-v2-transparent.avif&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fmcp-server%2Fmcp-hero-v2-transparent.avif&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fmcp-server%2Fmcp-hero-v2-transparent.avif&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fmcp-server%2Fmcp-hero-v2-transparent.avif&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F