w:focus-visible:ring-ink motion-reduce:tw:transition-none tw:translate-y-3 tw:opacity-0 tw:delay-0"><div><span class="tw:text-xs tw:font-semibold tw:uppercase tw:tracking-[0.14em] tw:text-[#ff8f00]">Quick access</span><div class="tw:mt-3 tw:grid tw:gap-0"><a class="tw:flex tw:min-h-8 tw:items-center tw:justify-between tw:gap-3 tw:py-1 tw:text-sm tw:font-medium tw:!text-ink/70 tw:transition-colors tw:hover:!text-ink tw:focus-visible:outline-none tw:focus-visible:ring-2 tw:focus-visible:ring-ink" href="/en/mcp-server">Explore DSers MCP<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right tw:size-3.5 tw:shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><a class="tw:flex tw:min-h-8 tw:items-center tw:justify-between tw:gap-3 tw:py-1 tw:text-sm tw:font-medium tw:!text-ink/70 tw:transition-colors tw:hover:!text-ink tw:focus-visible:outline-none tw:focus-visible:ring-2 tw:focus-visible:ring-ink" href="https://www.dsers.dev/">Open API<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right tw:size-3.5 tw:shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><a class="tw:text-sm tw:font-semibold tw:text-ink/82 tw:whitespace-nowrap tw:transition-colors tw:hover:text-black tw:focus-visible:outline-none tw:focus-visible:ring-2 tw:focus-visible:ring-ink" href="/dsers-ai-dropshipping">AI Agent</a><a class="tw:text-sm tw:font-semibold tw:text-ink/82 tw:whitespace-nowrap tw:transition-colors tw:hover:text-black tw:focus-visible:outline-none tw:focus-visible:ring-2 tw:focus-visible:ring-ink" href="/pricing">Pricing</a><a class="tw:box-border tw:flex tw:shrink-0 tw:items-center tw:gap-1.5 tw:rounded-full tw:bg-linear-to-r tw:from-surface-lilac tw:to-surface-cream tw:font-semibold tw:whitespace-nowrap tw:text-ink tw:min-h-8 tw:px-3 tw:py-1.5 tw:text-xs tw:2xl:text-sm" href="/dsers-linkup"><img alt="Linkup" loading="lazy" width="594" height="209" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="tw:h-4 tw:w-auto tw:2xl:h-[18px]" style="color:transparent" src="https://img.dsers.com/dserswebsite/linkup-wordmark.svg"/><span class="tw:ml-auto tw:rounded-full tw:bg-ink-950 tw:px-1.5 tw:py-[3px] tw:text-[9px] tw:font-semibold tw:leading-none tw:tracking-wide tw:text-white tw:md:text-[10px]">2026</span></a></div><div class="tw:hidden tw:shrink-0 tw:items-center tw:gap-3 tw:xl:flex tw:2xl:gap-4"><a href="https://accounts.dsers.com/accounts/login" class="tw:text-sm tw:font-semibold tw:text-ink tw:hover:text-black">Log in</a><a href="https://accounts.dsers.com/accounts/register" class="tw:inline-flex tw:min-h-10 tw:items-center tw:gap-2 tw:rounded-full tw:bg-ink tw:px-5 tw:text-sm tw:font-bold tw:text-white tw:transition-transform tw:hover:-translate-y-0.5 tw:focus-visible:outline-none tw:focus-visible:ring-2 tw:focus-visible:ring-ink">Try for free <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right tw:size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></div><button type="button" class="tw:grid tw:size-10 tw:place-items-center tw:border-0 tw:bg-transparent tw:p-0 tw:text-ink tw:transition-opacity tw:hover:opacity-60 tw:focus-visible:outline-none tw:xl:hidden" aria-label="Open navigation menu" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-menu tw:size-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h16"></path><path d="M4 12h16"></path><path d="M4 19h16"></path></svg></button></nav></header><div><main class="integration_page__KNyrG tw:font-sans tw:[--ui-content-width-wide:90rem] tw:[--ui-page-gutter:1rem] tw:[--ui-section-space:4.5rem] tw:md:[--ui-page-gutter:3.125rem] tw:md:[--ui-section-space:6rem] tw:lg:[--ui-page-gutter:5.625rem] tw:lg:[--ui-section-space:7.5rem]"><section class="integration_hero__4g2c6" aria-labelledby="integration-title"><div class="integration_heroContent__CTKcv"><h1 id="integration-title">DSers Integrations</h1><p>Connect DSers with supported sourcing platforms, ecommerce sales channels, and payment methods. Manage product sourcing, order processing, and tracking updates through one connected dropshipping workflow.</p><a href="https://accounts.dsers.com/accounts/register" class="tw:inline-flex tw:shrink-0 tw:items-center tw:justify-center tw:gap-2 tw:rounded-control tw:font-semibold tw:transition-colors tw:duration-fast tw:ease-standard tw:focus-visible:outline-none tw:focus-visible:ring-2 tw:focus-visible:ring-accent-500 tw:focus-visible:ring-offset-2 tw:disabled:pointer-events-none tw:disabled:opacity-50 tw:bg-ink-950 tw:text-white tw:hover:bg-ink-700 tw:min-h-12 tw:px-6 tw:text-base integration_heroCta__hHaDx tw:rounded-full">Get Started <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div><div class="integration_logoRail__4Oshg" tabindex="0" aria-label="Supported ecommerce platforms; focus or hover to pause"><div class="integration_logoTrack__uwzdK"><img src="https://img.dsers.com/dserswebsite/integration/remote/partner-shopify.avif" alt="Shopify" aria-hidden="false" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><img src="https://img.dsers.com/dserswebsite/integration/remote/partner-woocommerce.avif" alt="WooCommerce" aria-hidden="false" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><img src="https://img.dsers.com/dserswebsite/integration/remote/partner-jumpseller.avif" alt="Jumpseller" aria-hidden="false" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><img src="https://img.dsers.com/dserswebsite/integration/remote/partner-amazon.avif" alt="Amazon" aria-hidden="false" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><img src="https://img.dsers.com/dserswebsite/integration/remote/partner-aliexpress.avif" alt="AliExpress" aria-hidden="false" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><img src="https://img.dsers.com/dserswebsite/integration/remote/partner-tiktok.avif" alt="TikTok" aria-hidden="false" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><img src="https://img.dsers.com/dserswebsite/integration/remote/partner-ecwid.avif" alt="Ecwid" aria-hidden="false" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><img src="https://img.dsers.com/dserswebsite/integration/remote/partner-cartpanda.avif" alt="Cartpanda" aria-hidden="false" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><img src="https://img.dsers.com/dserswebsite/integration/remote/partner-shopify.avif" alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><img src="https://img.dsers.com/dserswebsite/integration/remote/partner-woocommerce.avif" alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><img src="https://img.dsers.com/dserswebsite/integration/remote/partner-jumpseller.avif" alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><img src="https://img.dsers.com/dserswebsite/integration/remote/partner-amazon.avif" alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><img src="https://img.dsers.com/dserswebsite/integration/remote/partner-aliexpress.avif" alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><img src="https://img.dsers.com/dserswebsite/integration/remote/partner-tiktok.avif" alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><img src="https://img.dsers.com/dserswebsite/integration/remote/partner-ecwid.avif" alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><img src="https://img.dsers.com/dserswebsite/integration/remote/partner-cartpanda.avif" alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div></div></section><section class="integration_workflowSection__iwaup" aria-labelledby="integration-workflow-title"><div class="integration_shell__4aTC3"><p class="integration_kicker__DcCiM">CONNECTED COMMERCE WORKFLOW</p><h2 id="integration-workflow-title">How DSers integrations connect your commerce workflow</h2><p class="integration_sectionIntro__3R_M2">DSers integrations connect the services used before, during, and after an order. Link supported supplier platforms and sales channels, process connected-store orders in DSers, and return fulfillment updates through the supported workflow.</p><div class="integration_workflowTable__pEiHJ" role="table" aria-label="Disconnected and connected ecommerce workflow comparison"><div class="integration_workflowRow__W9p77 integration_workflowHead__zAYkN" role="row"><span role="columnheader">Workflow stage</span><span role="columnheader">Without a connected workflow</span><span role="columnheader">With DSers integrations</span></div><div class="integration_workflowRow__W9p77" role="row"><strong role="cell">Source products</strong><span role="cell" data-label="Without connection">Supplier research and store data live in separate tools.</span><span role="cell" data-label="With DSers">Use supported sourcing platforms and map products to the stores connected to DSers.</span></div><div class="integration_workflowRow__W9p77" role="row"><strong role="cell">Process orders</strong><span role="cell" data-label="Without connection">Order details are checked and transferred between systems.</span><span role="cell" data-label="With DSers">Bring supported store orders into DSers, select the mapped supplier and shipping method, and place the supplier order.</span></div><div class="integration_workflowRow__W9p77" role="row"><strong role="cell">Update fulfillment</strong><span role="cell" data-label="Without connection">Tracking numbers are copied back manually.</span><span role="cell" data-label="With DSers">When tracking becomes available, DSers can return the update through the supported store workflow and, where applicable, PayPal.</span></div></div></div></section><section class="integration_storySection__XYb_4" aria-labelledby="integration-story-title"><div class="integration_shell__4aTC3"><p class="integration_kicker__DcCiM">THE DSERS INTEGRATION ECOSYSTEM</p><h2 id="integration-story-title">Explore every DSers integration</h2><p class="integration_storyIntro__PNjvO">Scroll through the supported platforms, channels, and payment methods that connect with the DSers workflow. The sequence starts with the names merchants are most likely to recognize, while each card keeps its exact role clear.</p><div class="integration_storyList__3vWiT"><div class="integration_storyCluster__JgeV6"><article data-brand="aliexpress" class="integration_storyItem__WWQcQ integration_storyMotion__xVejq" style="--story-tone:#171819;--story-index:0;--stack-offset:0px;transform:translateY(18px) scale(0.992)"><div class="integration_storyCopy__NqlsS"><p class="integration_storyMeta__y14ix"><span>01</span>Sourcing platform</p><p class="integration_storyLead__dOE5a">AliExpress serves more than 150 million consumers across over 200 countries and regions.</p><p class="integration_storyDetail__MKgP9">Connect your AliExpress account to DSers to source products, place supported supplier orders, and return tracking updates through the connected workflow.</p><div class="integration_storyName__4uh1X"><h3>AliExpress</h3><a class="integration_storyLink__13nsW" href="/en/integration/aliexpress-dropshipping-service">See What Unlocks Here <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div><figure class="integration_storyVisual___bWHL"><img alt="AliExpress integration with DSers" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="integration_storyImage__RtFBa" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 46vw, (min-width: 768px) 48vw, calc(100vw - 59px)" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Faliexpress-sourcing.avif&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Faliexpress-sourcing.avif&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Faliexpress-sourcing.avif&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Faliexpress-sourcing.avif&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Faliexpress-sourcing.avif&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Faliexpress-sourcing.avif&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Faliexpress-sourcing.avif&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Faliexpress-sourcing.avif&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Faliexpress-sourcing.avif&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Faliexpress-sourcing.avif&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><span class="integration_storyShade__MTpUc" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="integration_storyLogo__6HmRo"><img src="https://img.dsers.com/dserswebsite/integration/remote/partner-aliexpress.avif" alt="AliExpress" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><figcaption>A global catalog, connected to your store.</figcaption></figure></article><article data-brand="shopify" class="integration_storyItem__WWQcQ integration_storyMotion__xVejq" style="--story-tone:#20261f;--story-index:1;--stack-offset:8px;transform:translateY(18px) scale(0.992)"><div class="integration_storyCopy__NqlsS"><p class="integration_storyMeta__y14ix"><span>02</span>Selling channel</p><p class="integration_storyLead__dOE5a">Millions of businesses in more than 175 countries use Shopify.</p><p class="integration_storyDetail__MKgP9">Connect Shopify to DSers to manage supported product, order, and tracking workflows from one workspace.</p><div class="integration_storyName__4uh1X"><h3>Shopify</h3><a class="integration_storyLink__13nsW" href="/en/integration/shopify-dropshipping-service">See What Unlocks Here <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div><figure class="integration_storyVisual___bWHL"><img alt="Shopify integration with DSers" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="integration_storyImage__RtFBa" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 46vw, (min-width: 768px) 48vw, calc(100vw - 59px)" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fshopify.avif&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fshopify.avif&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fshopify.avif&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fshopify.avif&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fshopify.avif&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fshopify.avif&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fshopify.avif&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fshopify.avif&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fshopify.avif&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fshopify.avif&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><span class="integration_storyShade__MTpUc" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="integration_storyLogo__6HmRo"><img src="https://img.dsers.com/dserswebsite/integration/remote/shopify-logo-white.avif" alt="Shopify" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><figcaption>Your store grows. Orders keep moving.</figcaption></figure></article><article data-brand="amazon" class="integration_storyItem__WWQcQ integration_storyMotion__xVejq" style="--story-tone:#1e2630;--story-index:2;--stack-offset:16px;transform:translateY(18px) scale(0.992)"><div class="integration_storyCopy__NqlsS"><p class="integration_storyMeta__y14ix"><span>03</span>Selling channel</p><p class="integration_storyLead__dOE5a">Independent sellers account for more than 60% of sales in Amazon’s store.</p><p class="integration_storyDetail__MKgP9">Connect Amazon to DSers to coordinate supported sourcing, supplier orders, inventory updates, and tracking.</p><div class="integration_storyName__4uh1X"><h3>Amazon</h3><a class="integration_storyLink__13nsW" href="/en/integration/amazon-dropshipping-service">See What Unlocks Here <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div><figure class="integration_storyVisual___bWHL"><img alt="Amazon integration with DSers" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="integration_storyImage__RtFBa" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 46vw, (min-width: 768px) 48vw, calc(100vw - 59px)" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Famazon.avif&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Famazon.avif&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Famazon.avif&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Famazon.avif&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Famazon.avif&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Famazon.avif&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Famazon.avif&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Famazon.avif&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Famazon.avif&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Famazon.avif&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><span class="integration_storyShade__MTpUc" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="integration_storyLogo__6HmRo"><img src="https://img.dsers.com/dserswebsite/integration/remote/amazon-logo.avif" alt="Amazon" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><figcaption>Everyday essentials. Orders in motion.</figcaption></figure></article></div><div class="integration_storyCluster__JgeV6"><article data-brand="tiktok" class="integration_storyItem__WWQcQ integration_storyMotion__xVejq" style="--story-tone:#2b211c;--story-index:3;--stack-offset:0px;transform:translateY(18px) scale(0.992)"><div class="integration_storyCopy__NqlsS"><p class="integration_storyMeta__y14ix"><span>04</span>Selling channel</p><p class="integration_storyLead__dOE5a">TikTok Shop brings product discovery and checkout into the same content-led shopping experience.</p><p class="integration_storyDetail__MKgP9">Connect TikTok Shop to DSers for supported product sourcing, order processing, and tracking updates.</p><div class="integration_storyName__4uh1X"><h3>TikTok</h3><a class="integration_storyLink__13nsW" href="/en/integration/tiktok-dropshipping-service">See What Unlocks Here <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div><figure class="integration_storyVisual___bWHL"><img alt="TikTok integration with DSers" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="integration_storyImage__RtFBa" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 46vw, (min-width: 768px) 48vw, calc(100vw - 59px)" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Ftiktok.avif&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2