12.07z"></path></svg><strong>TikTok</strong></span></div><figcaption>Make the moment. Keep orders moving.</figcaption></figure></article><article data-brand="woocommerce" class="integration_storyItem__WWQcQ integration_storyMotion__xVejq" style="--story-tone:#1a2425;--story-index:4;--stack-offset:8px;transform:translateY(18px) scale(0.992)"><div class="integration_storyCopy__NqlsS"><p class="integration_storyMeta__y14ix"><span>05</span>Selling channel</p><p class="integration_storyLead__dOE5a">WooCommerce reports more than 4.1 million live installations worldwide.</p><p class="integration_storyDetail__MKgP9">Use the DSers integration to connect your WooCommerce store with supported sourcing, order, and tracking workflows.</p><div class="integration_storyName__4uh1X"><h3>WooCommerce</h3><a class="integration_storyLink__13nsW" href="/en/integration/woocommerce-dropshipping-service">See What Unlocks Here <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div><figure class="integration_storyVisual___bWHL"><img alt="WooCommerce integration with DSers" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="integration_storyImage__RtFBa" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 46vw, (min-width: 768px) 48vw, calc(100vw - 59px)" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fwoocommerce.avif&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fwoocommerce.avif&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fwoocommerce.avif&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fwoocommerce.avif&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fwoocommerce.avif&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fwoocommerce.avif&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fwoocommerce.avif&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fwoocommerce.avif&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fwoocommerce.avif&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fwoocommerce.avif&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><span class="integration_storyShade__MTpUc" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="integration_storyLogo__6HmRo"><img src="https://img.dsers.com/dserswebsite/integration/remote/woocommerce-logo.avif" alt="WooCommerce" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><figcaption>Your store. Your way. Orders in sync.</figcaption></figure></article><article data-brand="alibaba-com" class="integration_storyItem__WWQcQ integration_storyMotion__xVejq" style="--story-tone:#272229;--story-index:5;--stack-offset:16px;transform:translateY(18px) scale(0.992)"><div class="integration_storyCopy__NqlsS"><p class="integration_storyMeta__y14ix"><span>06</span>Sourcing platform</p><p class="integration_storyLead__dOE5a">Alibaba.com serves tens of millions of small and medium-sized businesses across more than 190 countries and regions.</p><p class="integration_storyDetail__MKgP9">Use the supported DSers workflows for dropshipping or wholesale sourcing, then keep the related supplier orders and fulfillment steps connected.</p><div class="integration_storyName__4uh1X"><h3>Alibaba.com</h3><a class="integration_storyLink__13nsW" href="/en/integration/alibaba-dropshipping-service">See What Unlocks Here <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div><figure class="integration_storyVisual___bWHL"><img alt="Alibaba.com integration with DSers" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="integration_storyImage__RtFBa" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 46vw, (min-width: 768px) 48vw, calc(100vw - 59px)" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Falibaba-dropshipping.avif&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Falibaba-dropshipping.avif&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Falibaba-dropshipping.avif&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Falibaba-dropshipping.avif&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Falibaba-dropshipping.avif&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Falibaba-dropshipping.avif&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Falibaba-dropshipping.avif&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Falibaba-dropshipping.avif&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Falibaba-dropshipping.avif&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Falibaba-dropshipping.avif&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><span class="integration_storyShade__MTpUc" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="integration_storyLogo__6HmRo"><img src="https://img.dsers.com/dserswebsite/integration/logos/alibaba.avif" alt="Alibaba.com" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><figcaption>Dropshipping or wholesale. One global B2B source.</figcaption></figure></article></div><div class="integration_storyCluster__JgeV6"><article data-brand="1688" class="integration_storyItem__WWQcQ integration_storyMotion__xVejq" style="--story-tone:#222832;--story-index:6;--stack-offset:0px;transform:translateY(18px) scale(0.992)"><div class="integration_storyCopy__NqlsS"><p class="integration_storyMeta__y14ix"><span>07</span>Sourcing platform</p><p class="integration_storyLead__dOE5a">1688 serves more than one million paying members within China’s wholesale ecosystem.</p><p class="integration_storyDetail__MKgP9">Use the supported DSers routes for single-item dropshipping or wholesale quantities, with connection and payment steps matched to the sourcing route you choose.</p><div class="integration_storyName__4uh1X"><h3>1688</h3><a class="integration_storyLink__13nsW" href="/en/integration/1688-dropshipping-service">See What Unlocks Here <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div><figure class="integration_storyVisual___bWHL"><img alt="1688 integration with DSers" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="integration_storyImage__RtFBa" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 46vw, (min-width: 768px) 48vw, calc(100vw - 59px)" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2F1688-dropshipping.avif&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2F1688-dropshipping.avif&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2F1688-dropshipping.avif&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2F1688-dropshipping.avif&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2F1688-dropshipping.avif&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2F1688-dropshipping.avif&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2F1688-dropshipping.avif&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2F1688-dropshipping.avif&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2F1688-dropshipping.avif&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2F1688-dropshipping.avif&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><span class="integration_storyShade__MTpUc" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="integration_storyLogo__6HmRo"><strong class="integration_textLogo___vkvZ">1688</strong></div><figcaption>Single items or wholesale quantities, organized in DSers.</figcaption></figure></article><article data-brand="ebay" class="integration_storyItem__WWQcQ integration_storyMotion__xVejq" style="--story-tone:#2d241d;--story-index:7;--stack-offset:8px;transform:translateY(18px) scale(0.992)"><div class="integration_storyCopy__NqlsS"><p class="integration_storyMeta__y14ix"><span>08</span>Selling channel</p><p class="integration_storyLead__dOE5a">eBay connects more than 130 million active buyers with billions of live listings.</p><p class="integration_storyDetail__MKgP9">Connect eBay to DSers to manage supported product, order, inventory, and tracking updates in one workflow.</p><div class="integration_storyName__4uh1X"><h3>eBay</h3><a class="integration_storyLink__13nsW" href="/en/integration/ebay-dropshipping-service">See What Unlocks Here <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div><figure class="integration_storyVisual___bWHL"><img alt="eBay integration with DSers" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="integration_storyImage__RtFBa" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 46vw, (min-width: 768px) 48vw, calc(100vw - 59px)" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Febay.avif&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Febay.avif&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Febay.avif&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Febay.avif&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Febay.avif&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Febay.avif&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Febay.avif&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Febay.avif&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Febay.avif&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Febay.avif&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><span class="integration_storyShade__MTpUc" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="integration_storyLogo__6HmRo"><img src="https://img.dsers.com/dserswebsite/integration/remote/ebay-logo.avif" alt="eBay" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><figcaption>Great finds. Ready for their next home.</figcaption></figure></article><article data-brand="walmart" class="integration_storyItem__WWQcQ integration_storyMotion__xVejq" style="--story-tone:#162533;--story-index:8;--stack-offset:16px;transform:translateY(18px) scale(0.992)"><div class="integration_storyCopy__NqlsS"><p class="integration_storyMeta__y14ix"><span>09</span>Selling channel</p><p class="integration_storyLead__dOE5a">Walmart.com reaches more than 90 million unique visitors each month.</p><p class="integration_storyDetail__MKgP9">Connect Walmart to DSers to manage supported supplier, order, inventory, and tracking workflows without moving data between separate tools.</p><div class="integration_storyName__4uh1X"><h3>Walmart</h3><a class="integration_storyLink__13nsW" href="/en/integration/walmart-dropshipping-service">See What Unlocks Here <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div><figure class="integration_storyVisual___bWHL"><img alt="Walmart integration with DSers" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="integration_storyImage__RtFBa" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 46vw, (min-width: 768px) 48vw, calc(100vw - 59px)" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fwalmart.avif&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fwalmart.avif&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fwalmart.avif&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fwalmart.avif&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fwalmart.avif&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fwalmart.avif&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fwalmart.avif&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fwalmart.avif&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fwalmart.avif&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fwalmart.avif&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><span class="integration_storyShade__MTpUc" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="integration_storyLogo__6HmRo"><img src="https://img.dsers.com/dserswebsite/integration/remote/walmart-logo.avif" alt="Walmart" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><figcaption>More everyday value. Less busywork.</figcaption></figure></article></div><div class="integration_storyCluster__JgeV6"><article data-brand="wix" class="integration_storyItem__WWQcQ integration_storyMotion__xVejq" style="--story-tone:#251d34;--story-index:9;--stack-offset:0px;transform:translateY(18px) scale(0.992)"><div class="integration_storyCopy__NqlsS"><p class="integration_storyMeta__y14ix"><span>10</span>Selling channel</p><p class="integration_storyLead__dOE5a">Wix supports more than 300 million users across 190 countries.</p><p class="integration_storyDetail__MKgP9">Connect a Wix store to DSers for supported sourcing, order processing, and tracking workflows; Wix allows one connected store per DSers account.</p><div class="integration_storyName__4uh1X"><h3>Wix</h3><a class="integration_storyLink__13nsW" href="/en/integration/wix-dropshipping-service">See What Unlocks Here <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div><figure class="integration_storyVisual___bWHL"><img alt="Wix integration with DSers" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="integration_storyImage__RtFBa" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 46vw, (min-width: 768px) 48vw, calc(100vw - 59px)" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fwix.avif&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fwix.avif&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fwix.avif&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fwix.avif&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fwix.avif&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fwix.avif&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fwix.avif&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fwix.avif&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fwix.avif&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fwix.avif&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><span class="integration_storyShade__MTpUc" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="integration_storyLogo__6HmRo"><img src="https://img.dsers.com/dserswebsite/integration/remote/wix-logo.avif" alt="Wix" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><figcaption>Make it yours. Keep orders flowing.</figcaption></figure></article><article data-brand="paypal" class="integration_storyItem__WWQcQ integration_storyMotion__xVejq" style="--story-tone:#2b2218;--story-index:10;--stack-offset:8px;transform:translateY(18px) scale(0.992)"><div class="integration_storyCopy__NqlsS"><p class="integration_storyMeta__y14ix"><span>11</span>Payment method</p><p class="integration_storyLead__dOE5a">PayPal serves hundreds of millions of active consumer and merchant accounts around the world.</p><p class="integration_storyDetail__MKgP9">In DSers, PayPal can be used for supported subscription and supplier-order payments, while eligible order tracking can be returned to the connected PayPal account.</p><div class="integration_storyName__4uh1X"><h3>PayPal</h3><a class="integration_storyLink__13nsW" href="/en/integration/paypal-order-tracking">See What Unlocks Here <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div><figure class="integration_storyVisual___bWHL"><img alt="PayPal integration with DSers" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="integration_storyImage__RtFBa" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 46vw, (min-width: 768px) 48vw, calc(100vw - 59px)" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Fpaypal.avif&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Fpaypal.avif&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Fpaypal.avif&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Fpaypal.avif&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Fpaypal.avif&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Fpaypal.avif&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Fpaypal.avif&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Fpaypal.avif&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Fpaypal.avif&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Fpaypal.avif&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><span class="integration_storyShade__MTpUc" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="integration_storyLogo__6HmRo"><img src="https://img.dsers.com/dserswebsite/integration/remote/payment-paypal-wordmark.avif" alt="PayPal" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><figcaption>Payments and tracking updates, kept connected.</figcaption></figure></article><article data-brand="stripe" class="integration_storyItem__WWQcQ integration_storyMotion__xVejq" style="--story-tone:#1f2825;--story-index:11;--stack-offset:16px;transform:translateY(18px) scale(0.992)"><div class="integration_storyCopy__NqlsS"><p class="integration_storyMeta__y14ix"><span>12</span>Payment method</p><p class="integration_storyLead__dOE5a">Millions of businesses use Stripe directly or through a platform to process payments.</p><p class="integration_storyDetail__MKgP9">DSers supports Stripe for subscription and eligible supplier-order payments.</p><div class="integration_storyName__4uh1X"><h3>Stripe</h3><a class="integration_storyLink__13nsW" href="/en/integration/stripe">See What Unlocks Here <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div><figure class="integration_storyVisual___bWHL"><img alt="Stripe integration with DSers" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="integration_storyImage__RtFBa" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 46vw, (min-width: 768px) 48vw, calc(100vw - 59px)" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Fstripe.avif&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Fstripe.avif&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Fstripe.avif&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Fstripe.avif&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Fstripe.avif&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Fstripe.avif&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Fstripe.avif&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Fstripe.avif&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Fstripe.avif&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Fstripe.avif&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><span class="integration_storyShade__MTpUc" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="integration_storyLogo__6HmRo"><img src="https://img.dsers.com/dserswebsite/integration/remote/payment-stripe-wordmark.avif" alt="Stripe" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><figcaption>A global payment rail for supported DSers payments.</figcaption></figure></article></div><div class="integration_storyCluster__JgeV6"><article data-brand="bigcommerce" class="integration_storyItem__WWQcQ integration_storyMotion__xVejq" style="--story-tone:#171819;--story-index:12;--stack-offset:0px;transform:translateY(18px) scale(0.992)"><div class="integration_storyCopy__NqlsS"><p class="integration_storyMeta__y14ix"><span>13</span>Selling channel</p><p class="integration_storyLead__dOE5a">BigCommerce serves customers in more than 150 countries.</p><p class="integration_storyDetail__MKgP9">Connect a BigCommerce storefront to DSers to coordinate supported sourcing, supplier orders, inventory, and tracking.</p><div class="integration_storyName__4uh1X"><h3>BigCommerce</h3><a rel="noreferrer" class="integration_storyLink__13nsW" href="https://www.dsers.com/blog/dsers-bigcommerce/">See What Unlocks Here <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div><figure class="integration_storyVisual___bWHL"><img alt="BigCommerce integration with DSers" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="integration_storyImage__RtFBa" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 46vw, (min-width: 768px) 48vw, calc(100vw - 59px)" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fbigcommerce.avif&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fbigcommerce.avif&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fbigcommerce.avif&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fbigcommerce.avif&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fbigcommerce.avif&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fbigcommerce.avif&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fbigcommerce.avif&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fbigcommerce.avif&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fbigcommerce.avif&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fbigcommerce.avif&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><span class="integration_storyShade__MTpUc" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="integration_storyLogo__6HmRo"><img src="https://img.dsers.com/dserswebsite/integration/logos/bigcommerce.avif" alt="BigCommerce" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><figcaption>More storefronts. One steady flow.</figcaption></figure></article><article data-brand="squarespace" class="integration_storyItem__WWQcQ integration_storyMotion__xVejq" style="--story-tone:#20261f;--story-index:13;--stack-offset:8px;transform:translateY(18px) scale(0.992)"><div class="integration_storyCopy__NqlsS"><p class="integration_storyMeta__y14ix"><span>14</span>Selling channel</p><p class="integration_storyLead__dOE5a">Squarespace says it has served more than 14 million entrepreneurs across over 200 countries and territories.</p><p class="integration_storyDetail__MKgP9">Connect Squarespace to DSers for supported sourcing, order processing, inventory, and tracking workflows.</p><div class="integration_storyName__4uh1X"><h3>Squarespace</h3><a rel="noreferrer" class="integration_storyLink__13nsW" href="https://www.dsers.com/blog/dsers-squarespace/">See What Unlocks Here <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div><figure class="integration_storyVisual___bWHL"><img alt="Squarespace integration with DSers" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="integration_storyImage__RtFBa" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 46vw, (min-width: 768px) 48vw, calc(100vw - 59px)" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fsquarespace.avif&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fsquarespace.avif&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fsquarespace.avif&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fsquarespace.avif&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fsquarespace.avif&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fsquarespace.avif&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fsquarespace.avif&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fsquarespace.avif&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fsquarespace.avif&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fsquarespace.avif&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><span class="integration_storyShade__MTpUc" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="integration_storyLogo__6HmRo"><img src="https://img.dsers.com/dserswebsite/integration/logos/squarespace.avif" alt="Squarespace" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><figcaption>Beautiful storefronts. Effortless flow.</figcaption></figure></article><article data-brand="square" class="integration_storyItem__WWQcQ integration_storyMotion__xVejq" style="--story-tone:#1e2630;--story-index:14;--stack-offset:16px;transform:translateY(18px) scale(0.992)"><div class="integration_storyCopy__NqlsS"><p class="integration_storyMeta__y14ix"><span>15</span>Selling channel</p><p class="integration_storyLead__dOE5a">Square serves more than four million sellers and processes over $240 billion in annual payment volume worldwide.</p><p class="integration_storyDetail__MKgP9">Connect Square to DSers to bring supported online-store orders into your sourcing and fulfillment workflow.</p><div class="integration_storyName__4uh1X"><h3>Square</h3><a href="https://accounts.dsers.com/accounts/register" class="integration_storyLink__13nsW">See What Unlocks Here <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div><figure class="integration_storyVisual___bWHL"><img alt="Square integration with DSers" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="integration_storyImage__RtFBa" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 46vw, (min-width: 768px) 48vw, calc(100vw - 59px)" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fsquare.avif&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fsquare.avif&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fsquare.avif&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fsquare.avif&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fsquare.avif&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fsquare.avif&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fsquare.avif&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fsquare.avif&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fsquare.avif&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fsquare.avif&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><span class="integration_storyShade__MTpUc" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="integration_storyLogo__6HmRo"><img src="https://img.dsers.com/dserswebsite/integration/remote/square-logo.avif" alt="Square" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><figcaption>At the counter. Online. Connected.</figcaption></figure></article></div><div class="integration_storyCluster__JgeV6"><article data-brand="ecwid" class="integration_storyItem__WWQcQ integration_storyMotion__xVejq" style="--story-tone:#2b211c;--story-index:15;--stack-offset:0px;transform:translateY(18px) scale(0.992)"><div class="integration_storyCopy__NqlsS"><p class="integration_storyMeta__y14ix"><span>16</span>Selling channel</p><p class="integration_storyLead__dOE5a">Ecwid reports more than one million users across 175 countries.</p><p class="integration_storyDetail__MKgP9">Connect an Ecwid store to DSers to manage supported product, order, inventory, and tracking workflows from the same workspace.</p><div class="integration_storyName__4uh1X"><h3>Ecwid</h3><a rel="noreferrer" class="integration_storyLink__13nsW" href="https://www.dsers.com/blog/dsers-ecwid/">See What Unlocks Here <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div><figure class="integration_storyVisual___bWHL"><img alt="Ecwid integration with DSers" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="integration_storyImage__RtFBa" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 46vw, (min-width: 768px) 48vw, calc(100vw - 59px)" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fecwid.avif&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fecwid.avif&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/