ento</h3><a rel="noreferrer" class="integration_storyLink__13nsW" href="https://www.dsers.com/blog/dsers-magento/">See What Unlocks Here <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div><figure class="integration_storyVisual___bWHL"><img alt="Magento integration with DSers" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="integration_storyImage__RtFBa" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 46vw, (min-width: 768px) 48vw, calc(100vw - 59px)" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fmagento.avif&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fmagento.avif&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fmagento.avif&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fmagento.avif&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fmagento.avif&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fmagento.avif&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fmagento.avif&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fmagento.avif&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fmagento.avif&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fmagento.avif&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><span class="integration_storyShade__MTpUc" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="integration_storyLogo__6HmRo"><img src="https://img.dsers.com/dserswebsite/integration/logos/magento.avif" alt="Magento" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><figcaption>Complex catalogs. Connected orders.</figcaption></figure></article><article data-brand="shopline" class="integration_storyItem__WWQcQ integration_storyMotion__xVejq" style="--story-tone:#272229;--story-index:17;--stack-offset:16px;transform:translateY(18px) scale(0.992)"><div class="integration_storyCopy__NqlsS"><p class="integration_storyMeta__y14ix"><span>18</span>Selling channel</p><p class="integration_storyLead__dOE5a">SHOPLINE supports more than 600,000 merchants worldwide.</p><p class="integration_storyDetail__MKgP9">Connect a SHOPLINE store to DSers to manage supported sourcing, supplier orders, inventory, and tracking updates in one workflow.</p><div class="integration_storyName__4uh1X"><h3>Shopline</h3><a href="https://accounts.dsers.com/accounts/register" class="integration_storyLink__13nsW">See What Unlocks Here <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div><figure class="integration_storyVisual___bWHL"><img alt="Shopline integration with DSers" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="integration_storyImage__RtFBa" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 46vw, (min-width: 768px) 48vw, calc(100vw - 59px)" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fshopline.avif&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%