etail__MKgP9">Connect Jumpseller to DSers for supported sourcing, order processing, inventory, and tracking workflows.</p><div class="integration_storyName__4uh1X"><h3>Jumpseller</h3><a class="integration_storyLink__13nsW" href="/en/integration/jumpseller-dropshipping-service">See What Unlocks Here <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div><figure class="integration_storyVisual___bWHL"><img alt="Jumpseller integration with DSers" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="integration_storyImage__RtFBa" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 46vw, (min-width: 768px) 48vw, calc(100vw - 59px)" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fjumpseller.avif&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fjumpseller.avif&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fjumpseller.avif&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fjumpseller.avif&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fjumpseller.avif&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fjumpseller.avif&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fjumpseller.avif&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fjumpseller.avif&amp;w=2048&a