sparent" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 46vw, (min-width: 768px) 48vw, calc(100vw - 59px)" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fbig-cartel.avif&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fbig-cartel.avif&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fbig-cartel.avif&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fbig-cartel.avif&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fbig-cartel.avif&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fbig-cartel.avif&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fbig-cartel.avif&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fbig-cartel.avif&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fbig-cartel.avif&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fbig-cartel.avif&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><span class="integration_storyShade__MTpUc" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="integration_storyLogo__6HmRo"><img src="https://img.dsers.com/dserswebsite/integration/logos/big-cartel.avif" alt="Big Cartel" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><figcaption>Keep creating. Let the orders follow.</figcaption></figure></article><article data-brand="cartpanda" class="integration_storyItem__WWQcQ integration_storyMotion__xVejq" style="--story-tone:#162533;--story-index:20;--stack-offset:16px;transform:translateY(18px) scale(0.992)"><div class="integration_storyCopy__NqlsS"><p class="integration_storyMeta__y14ix"><span>21</span>Selling channel</p><p class="integration_storyLead__dOE5a">Cartpanda supports sellers in more than 150 countries and over 130 currencies.</p><p class="integration_storyDetail__MKgP9">Connect Cartpanda to DSers to coordinate supported sourcing, supplier orders, store inventory, and tracking updates.</p><div class="integration_storyName__4uh1X"><h3>Cartpanda</h3><a rel="noreferrer" class="integration_storyLink__13nsW" href="https://www.dsers.com/blog/dsers-cartpanda/">See What Unlocks Here <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div><figure class="integration_storyVisual___bWHL"><img alt="Cartpanda integration with DSers" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="integration_storyImage__RtFBa" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 46vw, (min-width: 768px) 48vw, calc(100vw - 59px)" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fcartpanda.avif&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fcartpanda.avif&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fcartpanda.avif&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fcartpanda.avif&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fcartpanda.avif&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fcartpanda.avif&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fcartpanda.avif&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fcartpanda.avif&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fcartpanda.avif&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fcartpanda.avif&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><span class="integration_storyShade__MTpUc" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="integration_storyLogo__6HmRo"><img src="https://img.dsers.com/dserswebsite/integration/logos/cartpanda.avif" alt="Cartpanda" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><figcaption>A great checkout. A smooth next step.</figcaption></figure></article></div><div class="integration_storyCluster__JgeV6"><article data-brand="genstore-ai" class="integration_storyItem__WWQcQ integration_storyMotion__xVejq" style="--story-tone:#251d34;--story-index:21;--stack-offset:0px;transform:translateY(18px) scale(0.992)"><div class="integration_storyCopy__NqlsS"><p class="integration_storyMeta__y14ix"><span>22</span>Selling channel</p><p class="integration_storyLead__dOE5a">Genstore.ai can generate a ready-to-sell storefront from a prompt in about two minutes.</p><p class="integration_storyDetail__MKgP9">Connect the store to DSers for supported sourcing, order processing, and tracking workflows.</p><div class="integration_storyName__4uh1X"><h3>Genstore.ai</h3><a href="https://accounts.dsers.com/accounts/register" class="integration_storyLink__13nsW">See What Unlocks Here <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div><figure class="integration_storyVisual___bWHL"><img alt="Genstore.ai integration with DSers" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="integration_storyImage__RtFBa" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 46vw, (min-width: 768px) 48vw, calc(100vw - 59px)" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fgenstore-ai.avif&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fgenstore-ai.avif&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fgenstore-ai.avif&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fgenstore-ai.avif&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fgenstore-ai.avif&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fgenstore-ai.avif&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fgenstore-ai.avif&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fgenstore-ai.avif&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fgenstore-ai.avif&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fgenstore-ai.avif&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><span class="integration_storyShade__MTpUc" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="integration_storyLogo__6HmRo"><img src="https://img.dsers.com/dserswebsite/integration/logos/genstore-ai.avif" alt="Genstore.ai" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><figcaption>From an idea to orders in motion.</figcaption></figure></article><article data-brand="lpqv" class="integration_storyItem__WWQcQ integration_storyMotion__xVejq" style="--story-tone:#2b2218;--story-index:22;--stack-offset:8px;transform:translateY(18px) scale(0.992)"><div class="integration_storyCopy__NqlsS"><p class="integration_storyMeta__y14ix"><span>23</span>Selling channel</p><p class="integration_storyLead__dOE5a">LPQV supports one-page or three-step checkout, gateway contingency, order bumps, and one-click upsells.</p><p class="integration_storyDetail__MKgP9">Use the DSers integration behind the storefront for supported product sourcing, order processing, and tracking.</p><div class="integration_storyName__4uh1X"><h3>LPQV</h3><a href="https://accounts.dsers.com/accounts/register" class="integration_storyLink__13nsW">See What Unlocks Here <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div><figure class="integration_storyVisual___bWHL"><img alt="LPQV integration with DSers" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="integration_storyImage__RtFBa" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 46vw, (min-width: 768px) 48vw, calc(100vw - 59px)" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Flpqv.avif&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Flpqv.avif&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Flpqv.avif&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Flpqv.avif&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Flpqv.avif&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Flpqv.avif&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Flpqv.avif&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Flpqv.avif&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Flpqv.avif&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Flpqv.avif&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><span class="integration_storyShade__MTpUc" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="integration_storyLogo__6HmRo"><img src="https://img.dsers.com/dserswebsite/integration/remote/lpqv-logo.avif" alt="LPQV" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><figcaption>From first interest to the next order.</figcaption></figure></article><article data-brand="csv" class="integration_storyItem__WWQcQ integration_storyMotion__xVejq" style="--story-tone:#1f2825;--story-index:23;--stack-offset:16px;transform:translateY(18px) scale(0.992)"><div class="integration_storyCopy__NqlsS"><p class="integration_storyMeta__y14ix"><span>24</span>File-based workflow</p><p class="integration_storyLead__dOE5a">CSV provides a file-based bridge for platforms DSers does not connect to directly, including custom-built storefronts.</p><p class="integration_storyDetail__MKgP9">Format the required product or order data with the current DSers template, then import it into the supported workflow.</p><div class="integration_storyName__4uh1X"><h3>CSV</h3><a class="integration_storyLink__13nsW" href="/en/integration/csv">See What Unlocks Here <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div><figure class="integration_storyVisual___bWHL"><img alt="CSV integration with DSers" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="integration_storyImage__RtFBa" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 46vw, (min-width: 768px) 48vw, calc(100vw - 59px)" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fcsv.avif&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fcsv.avif&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fcsv.avif&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fcsv.avif&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fcsv.avif&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fcsv.avif&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fcsv.avif&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fcsv.avif&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fcsv.avif&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Feditorial%2Fcsv.avif&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><span class="integration_storyShade__MTpUc" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="integration_storyLogo__6HmRo"><strong class="integration_textLogo___vkvZ">CSV</strong></div><figcaption>One file. A smoother flow of orders.</figcaption></figure></article></div><div class="integration_finalCluster__o_UmN"><article data-brand="dsers-verified-agent-network" class="integration_storyItem__WWQcQ integration_storyMotion__xVejq" style="--story-tone:#171819;--story-index:24;--stack-offset:0px;transform:translateY(18px) scale(0.992)"><div class="integration_storyCopy__NqlsS"><p class="integration_storyMeta__y14ix"><span>25</span>Sourcing platform</p><p class="integration_storyLead__dOE5a">Use the DSers Verified Agent Network to map products, place and pay for supported agent orders in batches, and sync available tracking back to connected stores.</p><p class="integration_storyDetail__MKgP9">PayPal and Stripe are supported for eligible agent-order payments.</p><div class="integration_storyName__4uh1X"><h3>DSers Verified Agent Network</h3><a class="integration_storyLink__13nsW" href="/en/integration/dsers-supplier-agent-network">See What Unlocks Here <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div><figure class="integration_storyVisual___bWHL"><img alt="DSers Verified Agent Network integration with DSers" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="integration_storyImage__RtFBa" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 46vw, (min-width: 768px) 48vw, calc(100vw - 59px)" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Fsupplier-agent-network.avif&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Fsupplier-agent-network.avif&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Fsupplier-agent-network.avif&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Fsupplier-agent-network.avif&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Fsupplier-agent-network.avif&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Fsupplier-agent-network.avif&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Fsupplier-agent-network.avif&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Fsupplier-agent-network.avif&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Fsupplier-agent-network.avif&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.dsers.com%2Fdserswebsite%2Fintegration%2Fgenerated%2Fsupplier-agent-network.avif&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><span class="integration_storyShade__MTpUc" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="integration_storyLogo__6HmRo"><img src="https://img.dsers.com/dserswebsite/integration/remote/dsers-logo.avif" alt="DSers Verified Agent Network" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><figcaption>Verified sourcing support, mapped to your workflow.</figcaption></figure></article></div></div></div></section><section class="integration_connectSection__QNRPm" aria-labelledby="integration-connect-title"><div class="integration_shell__4aTC3"><p class="integration_kicker__DcCiM">CHOOSE YOUR CONNECTION PATH</p><h2 id="integration-connect-title">Bring each part of your commerce workflow into DSers</h2><p class="integration_sectionIntro__3R_M2">DSers partners serve different roles, so there is no single setup path for every integration. Start with the connection type that matches the part of your workflow you want to manage.</p><ol class="integration_connectionSteps__mgrik"><li><span>01</span><div><h3>Sales channels</h3><p>Connect supported storefronts and marketplaces from DSers through<!-- --> <strong>LINK TO MORE STORES</strong>, then follow the platform-specific authorization flow. Confirm connected stores in the Store Switcher or under<!-- --> <strong>Settings &gt; Application Management &gt; Sales Channel</strong>.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><h3>Sourcing partners</h3><p>Choose a supported supplier platform or the DSers Verified Agent Network to build the sourcing route that fits your products and fulfillment needs. Available connection, ordering, and payment steps vary by partner.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><h3>Payment and tracking services</h3><p>Use PayPal or Stripe for the eligible payment workflows supported by each service. Where applicable, DSers can also return supplier tracking updates through the connected workflow.</p></div></li><li><span>04</span><div><h3>CSV and custom storefronts</h3><p>If your platform or self-built store does not have a direct DSers integration, use the CSV workflow to move supported product or order data into DSers with the current file template.</p></div></li></ol></div></section><div class="tw:relative tw:isolate tw:bg-white"><div class="tw:sticky tw:top-0 tw:z-10"><section class="tw:bg-white tw:px-[var(--ui-page-gutter)] tw:text-center tw:py-[var(--ui-section-space)]"><div class="tw:mx-auto tw:max-w-5xl"><h2 class="tw:font-sans tw:text-4xl tw:font-semibold tw:leading-[0.98] tw:tracking-[-0.045em] tw:text-ink tw:md:text-[2.75rem] tw:lg:text-[3.5rem]"><span class="conversionFaqStack_rotatingHeadline__QVhi_" aria-label="Source smarter. Fulfill faster."><span class="conversionFaqStack_sourceHeadline__7LwuW" aria-hidden="true">Source smarter.</span><span class="conversionFaqStack_fulfillHeadline__fBZoh" aria-hidden="true">Fulfill faster.</span></span><span class="tw:block">Automate more with DSers.</span></h2><p class="tw:mx-auto tw:mt-6 tw:max-w-2xl tw:text-base tw:leading-7 tw:text-ink/62 tw:md:text-lg tw:md:leading-8">Connect the sourcing, sales, and payment services you use, then manage the supported order workflow from one DSers workspace.</p><a href="https://accounts.dsers.com/accounts/register" class="tw:mt-9 tw:inline-flex tw:min-h-14 tw:items-center tw:gap-2 tw:rounded-full tw:bg-ink tw:px-8 tw:font-bold tw:text-white tw:transition-transform tw:hover:-translate-y-0.5 tw:focus-visible:outline-none tw:focus-visible:ring-2 tw:focus-visible:ring-ink tw:focus-visible:ring-offset-4">Get Started<!-- --> <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right tw:size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></section></div><div class="tw:pointer-events-none tw:h-px"></div><div class="tw:relative tw:z-20 tw:overflow-hidden tw:rounded-t-[2rem] tw:will-change-transform tw:md:rounded-t-[2.5rem] " style="transform:translateY(96px)"><section id="integration-faqs" class="tw:bg-canvas-dark tw:px-[var(--ui-page-gutter)] tw:pb-24 tw:pt-20 tw:text-white tw:md:pb-28 tw:md:pt-24"><div class="tw:mx-auto tw:max-w-[var(--ui-content-width-wide)]"><h2 class="tw:font-sans tw:text-4xl tw:font-semibold tw:leading-[0.98] tw:tracking-[-0.045em] tw:md:text-[2.75rem] tw:lg:text-[3.5rem]">FAQ</h2><div class="tw:mt-14 tw:border-t tw:border-white/40 tw:md:mt-16"><details class="conversionFaqStack_faqItem__zHdwE tw:border-b tw:border-white/30"><summary class="conversionFaqStack_faqSummary__Zj9d1 tw:flex tw:cursor-pointer tw:items-center tw:justify-between tw:gap-6 tw:px-3 tw:py-7 tw:font-sans tw:text-lg tw:font-normal tw:leading-snug tw:focus-visible:bg-white/5 tw:focus-visible:outline-none tw:md:px-10 tw:md:py-8 tw:md:text-2xl"><span>What is DSers E-Commerce Integration?</span><span class="conversionFaqStack_faqIcon__tG6s2 tw:relative tw:size-7 tw:shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><span class="tw:absolute tw:left-1/2 tw:top-1/2 tw:h-px tw:w-6 tw:-translate-x-1/2 tw:-translate-y-1/2 tw:bg-white"></span><span class="tw:absolute tw:left-1/2 tw:top-1/2 tw:h-6 tw:w-px tw:-translate-x-1/2 tw:-translate-y-1/2 tw:bg-white"></span></span></summary><p class="tw:max-w-4xl tw:px-3 tw:pb-8 tw:pr-14 tw:leading-7 tw:text-white/60 tw:md:px-10 tw:md:pb-9 tw:md:pr-24 tw:md:text-lg tw:md:leading-8">DSers integrations connect supported sourcing platforms, ecommerce sales channels, and payment methods with the product, order, and tracking workflows available in DSers.</p></details><details class="conversionFaqStack_faqItem__zHdwE tw:border-b tw:border-white/30"><summary class="conversionFaqStack_faqSummary__Zj9d1 tw:flex tw:cursor-pointer tw:items-center tw:justify-between tw:gap-6 tw:px-3 tw:py-7 tw:font-sans tw:text-lg tw:font-normal tw:leading-snug tw:focus-visible:bg-white/5 tw:focus-visible:outline-none tw:md:px-10 tw:md:py-8 tw:md:text-2xl"><span>Which selling platforms does DSers integrate with?</span><span class="conversionFaqStack_faqIcon__tG6s2 tw:relative tw:size-7 tw:shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><span class="tw:absolute tw:left-1/2 tw:top-1/2 tw:h-px tw:w-6 tw:-translate-x-1/2 tw:-translate-y-1/2 tw:bg-white"></span><span class="tw:absolute tw:left-1/2 tw:top-1/2 tw:h-6 tw:w-px tw:-translate-x-1/2 tw:-translate-y-1/2 tw:bg-white"></span></span></summary><p class="tw:max-w-4xl tw:px-3 tw:pb-8 tw:pr-14 tw:leading-7 tw:text-white/60 tw:md:px-10 tw:md:pb-9 tw:md:pr-24 tw:md:text-lg tw:md:leading-8">DSers supports Shopify, Wix, WooCommerce, eBay, TikTok Shop, Amazon, Walmart, Big Cartel, Jumpseller, Cartpanda, Square, Ecwid, BigCommerce, Squarespace, SHOPLINE, LPQV, Magento, Genstore.ai, and CSV workflows. Check the channel list inside DSers for the latest availability.</p></details><details class="conversionFaqStack_faqItem__zHdwE tw:border-b tw:border-white/30"><summary class="conversionFaqStack_faqSummary__Zj9d1 tw:flex tw:cursor-pointer tw:items-center tw:justify-between tw:gap-6 tw:px-3 tw:py-7 tw:font-sans tw:text-lg tw:font-normal tw:leading-snug tw:focus-visible:bg-white/5 tw:focus-visible:outline-none tw:md:px-10 tw:md:py-8 tw:md:text-2xl"><span>What sourcing platforms does DSers connect to?</span><span class="conversionFaqStack_faqIcon__tG6s2 tw:relative tw:size-7 tw:shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><span class="tw:absolute tw:left-1/2 tw:top-1/2 tw:h-px tw:w-6 tw:-translate-x-1/2 tw:-translate-y-1/2 tw:bg-white"></span><span class="tw:absolute tw:left-1/2 tw:top-1/2 tw:h-6 tw:w-px tw:-translate-x-1/2 tw:-translate-y-1/2 tw:bg-white"></span></span></summary><p class="tw:max-w-4xl tw:px-3 tw:pb-8 tw:pr-14 tw:leading-7 tw:text-white/60 tw:md:px-10 tw:md:pb-9 tw:md:pr-24 tw:md:text-lg tw:md:leading-8">DSers supports sourcing workflows for AliExpress, Alibaba.com, 1688, and the DSers Verified Agent Network. Alibaba.com and 1688 include supported routes for dropshipping and wholesale sourcing; connection and payment steps vary by route.</p></details><details class="conversionFaqStack_faqItem__zHdwE tw:border-b tw:border-white/30"><summary class="conversionFaqStack_faqSummary__Zj9d1 tw:flex tw:cursor-pointer tw:items-center tw:justify-between tw:gap-6 tw:px-3 tw:py-7 tw:font-sans tw:text-lg tw:font-normal tw:leading-snug tw:focus-visible:bg-white/5 tw:focus-visible:outline-none tw:md:px-10 tw:md:py-8 tw:md:text-2xl"><span>What is the difference between 1688 dropshipping and 1688 wholesale in DSers?</span><span class="conversionFaqStack_faqIcon__tG6s2 tw:relative tw:size-7 tw:shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><span class="tw:absolute tw:left-1/2 tw:top-1/2 tw:h-px tw:w-6 tw:-translate-x-1/2 tw:-translate-y-1/2 tw:bg-white"></span><span class="tw:absolute tw:left-1/2 tw:top-1/2 tw:h-6 tw:w-px tw:-translate-x-1/2 tw:-translate-y-1/2 tw:bg-white"></span></span></summary><p class="tw:max-w-4xl tw:px-3 tw:pb-8 tw:pr-14 tw:leading-7 tw:text-white/60 tw:md:px-10 tw:md:pb-9 tw:md:pr-24 tw:md:text-lg tw:md:leading-8">1688 dropshipping allows one-piece order fulfillment with inventory, orders, and tracking synced automatically — distinct from 1688 wholesale, which is for bulk procurement at lower unit costs with tiered volume discounts, flexible air or sea shipping, blind ordering, and professional warehousing support.</p></details><details class="conversionFaqStack_faqItem__zHdwE tw:border-b tw:border-white/30"><summary class="conversionFaqStack_faqSummary__Zj9d1 tw:flex tw:cursor-pointer tw:items-center tw:justify-between tw:gap-6 tw:px-3 tw:py-7 tw:font-sans tw:text-lg tw:font-normal tw:leading-snug tw:focus-visible:bg-white/5 tw:focus-visible:outline-none tw:md:px-10 tw:md:py-8 tw:md:text-2xl"><span>How does DSers handle payment and tracking sync?</span><span class="conversionFaqStack_faqIcon__tG6s2 tw:relative tw:size-7 tw:shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><span class="tw:absolute tw:left-1/2 tw:top-1/2 tw:h-px tw:w-6 tw:-translate-x-1/2 tw:-translate-y-1/2 tw:bg-white"></span><span class="tw:absolute tw:left-1/2 tw:top-1/2 tw:h-6 tw:w-px tw:-translate-x-1/2 tw:-translate-y-1/2 tw:bg-white"></span></span></summary><p class="tw:max-w-4xl tw:px-3 tw:pb-8 tw:pr-14 tw:leading-7 tw:text-white/60 tw:md:px-10 tw:md:pb-9 tw:md:pr-24 tw:md:text-lg tw:md:leading-8">DSers supports PayPal and Stripe for eligible subscription and supplier-order payments. When supplier tracking becomes available, DSers can return the update through supported store workflows and, where applicable, PayPal.</p></details><details class="conversionFaqStack_faqItem__zHdwE tw:border-b tw:border-white/30"><summary class="conversionFaqStack_faqSummary__Zj9d1 tw:flex tw:cursor-pointer tw:items-center tw:justify-between tw:gap-6 tw:px-3 tw:py-7 tw:font-sans tw:text-lg tw:font-normal tw:leading-snug tw:focus-visible:bg-white/5 tw:focus-visible:outline-none tw:md:px-10 tw:md:py-8 tw:md:text-2xl"><span>Can I use DSers if my selling platform is not on the integration list?</span><span class="conversionFaqStack_faqIcon__tG6s2 tw:relative tw:size-7 tw:shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><span class="tw:absolute tw:left-1/2 tw:top-1/2 tw:h-px tw:w-6 tw:-translate-x-1/2 tw:-translate-y-1/2 tw:bg-white"></span><span class="tw:absolute tw:left-1/2 tw:top-1/2 tw:h-6 tw:w-px tw:-translate-x-1/2 tw:-translate-y-1/2 tw:bg-white"></span></span></summary><p class="tw:max-w-4xl tw:px-3 tw:pb-8 tw:pr-14 tw:leading-7 tw:text-white/60 tw:md:px-10 tw:md:pb-9 tw:md:pr-24 tw:md:text-lg tw:md:leading-8">CSV import provides a file-based workflow for platforms without a direct DSers connection. Download the current template, complete the required product or order fields, and upload the file to DSers.</p></details></div></div></section></div></div></main></div><!--$--><footer class="tw:bg-canvas-dark tw:px-[var(--ui-page-gutter)] tw:pb-8 tw:pt-14 tw:font-sans tw:text-white"><div class="tw:mx-auto tw:max-w-[var(--ui-content-width-wide)]"><div class="tw:grid tw:gap-x-10 tw:gap-y-12 tw:border-b tw:border-white/12 tw:pb-14 tw:sm:grid-cols-2 tw:lg:grid-cols-4"><nav aria-label="Company footer navigation"><h2 class="tw:text-lg tw:font-semibold tw:text-white">Company</h2><ul class="tw:mt-5 tw:grid tw:list-none tw:gap-3 tw:p-0"><li><a class="tw:inline-flex tw:py-0.5 tw:text-sm tw:leading-5 tw:!text-white/55 tw:transition-[color,transform] tw:duration-200 tw:hover:translate-x-1 tw:hover:!text-white tw:focus-visible:outline-none tw:focus-visible:ring-2 tw:focus-visible:ring-white" href="/en/about-us">About Us</a></li><li><a class="tw:inline-flex tw:py-0.5 tw:text-sm tw:leading-5 tw:!text-white/55 tw:transition-[color,transform] tw:duration-200 tw:hover:translate-x-1 tw:hover:!text-white tw:focus-visible:outline-none tw:focus-visible:ring-2 tw:focus-visible:ring-white" href="/en/contact">Contact us</a></li><li><a class="tw:inline-flex tw:py-0.5 tw:text-sm tw:leading-5 tw:!text-white/55 tw:transition-[color,transform] tw:duration-200 tw:hover:translate-x-1 tw:hover:!text-white tw:focus-visible:outline-none tw:focus-visible:ring-2 tw:focus-visible:ring-white" href="/en/partner">Partner</a></li><li><a class="tw:inline-flex tw:py-0.5 tw:text-sm tw:leading-5 tw:!text-white/55 tw:transition-[color,transform] tw:duration-200 tw:hover:translate-x-1 tw:hover:!text-white tw:focus-visible:outline-none tw:focus-visible:ring-2 tw:focus-visible:ring-white" href="/en/privacy">Privacy Policy</a></li><li><a class="tw:inline-flex tw:py-0.5 tw:text-sm tw:leading-5 tw:!text-white/55 tw:transition-[color,transform] tw:duration-200 tw:hover:translate-x-1 tw:hover:!text-white tw:focus-visible:outline-none tw:focus-visible:ring-2 tw:focus-visible:ring-white" href="/en/terms-of-service">Terms of Service</a></li></ul></nav><nav aria-label="Solutions footer navigation"><h2 class="tw:text-lg tw:font-semibold tw:text-white">Solutions</h2><ul class="tw:mt-5 tw:grid tw:list-none tw:gap-3 tw:p-0"><li><a class="tw:inline-flex tw:py-0.5 tw:text-sm tw:leading-5 tw:!text-white/55 tw:transition-[color,transform] tw:duration-200 tw:hover:translate-x-1 tw:hover:!text-white tw:focus-visible:outline-none tw:focus-visible:ring-2 tw:focus-visible:ring-white" href="/en/features">Dropshipping Solution</a></li><li><a class="tw:inline-flex tw:py-0.5 tw:text-sm tw:leading-5 tw:!text-white/55 tw:transition-[color,transform] tw:duration-200 tw:hover:translate-x-1 tw:hover:!text-white tw:focus-visible:outline-none tw:focus-visible:ring-2 tw:focus-visible:ring-white" href="/en/features/multi-supplier-sourcing">Multi-Supplier Sourcing</a></li><li><a class="tw:inline-flex tw:py-0.5 tw:text-sm tw:leading-5 tw:!text-white/55 tw:transition-[color,transform] tw:duration-200 tw:hover:translate-x-1 tw:hover:!text-white tw:focus-visible:outline-none tw:focus-visible:ring-2 tw:focus-visible:ring-white" href="/en/features/ai-optimize-product-info">AI Optimize Product Info</a></li><li><a class="tw:inline-flex tw:py-0.5 tw:text-sm tw:leading-5 tw:!text-white/55 tw:transition-[color,transform] tw:duration-200 tw:hover:translate-x-1 tw:hover:!text-white tw:focus-visible:outline-none tw:focus-visible:ring-2 tw:focus-visible:ring-white" href="/en/features/automatic-pricing">Bulk Price Auto-Update</a></li><li><a class="tw:inline-flex tw:py-0.5 tw:text-sm tw:leading-5 tw:!text-white/55 tw:transition-[color,transform] tw:duration-200 tw:hover:translate-x-1 tw:hover:!text-white tw:focus-visible:outline-none tw:focus-visible:ring-2 tw:focus-visible:ring-white" href="/en/features/stock-management">Stock Auto-Update</a></li><li><a class="tw:inline-flex tw:py-0.5 tw:text-sm tw:leading-5 tw:!text-white/55 tw:transition-[color,transform] tw:duration-200 tw:hover:translate-x-1 tw:hover:!text-white tw:focus-visible:outline-none tw:focus-visible:ring-2 tw:focus-visible:ring-white" href="/en/features/auto-update-order-status">Auto Update Order Status</a></li><li><a class="tw:inline-flex tw:py-0.5 tw:text-sm tw:leading-5 tw:!text-white/55 tw:transition-[color,transform] tw:duration-200 tw:hover:translate-x-1 tw:hover:!text-white tw:focus-visible:outline-none tw:focus-visible:ring-2 tw:focus-visible:ring-white" href="/en/features/auto-sync-tracking-numbers">Auto Sync Tracking Number</a></li><li><a class="tw:inline-flex tw:py-0.5 tw:text-sm tw:leading-5 tw:!text-white/55 tw:transition-[color,transform] tw:duration-200 tw:hover:translate-x-1 tw:hover:!text-white tw:focus-visible:outline-none tw:focus-visible:ring-2 tw:focus-visible:ring-white" href="/en/features/shipment-tracking-alerts">Shipment Tracking &amp; Alerts</a></li><li><a class="tw:inline-flex tw:py-0.5 tw:text-sm tw:leading-5 tw:!text-white/55 tw:transition-[color,transform] tw:duration-200 tw:hover:translate-x-1 tw:hover:!text-white tw:focus-visible:outline-none tw:focus-visible:ring-2 tw:focus-visible:ring-white" href="/en/features/branded-tracking-page">Branded Tracking Page</a></li><li><a class="tw:inline-flex tw:py-0.5 tw:text-sm tw:leading-5 tw:!text-white/55 tw:transition-[color,transform] tw:duration-200 tw:hover:translate-x-1 tw:hover:!text-white tw:focus-visible:outline-none tw:focus-visible:ring-2 tw:focus-visible:ring-white" href="/en/features/multiple-stores